<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Telebras still a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Telebras still a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- ING Barings said it was maintaining its year-end price target of $150 and buy rating on Brazilian federal telecom firm Telebras.</p>
<p>-- The report followed the release of Telebras' January-to-February earnings of 506 million reais.</p>
<p>-- Telebras preferred closed at 116.50 reais, off 1.93 percent, on the Sao Paulo bourse.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
